    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mason Estates presents to the market, this three bedroom mid-terrace home situated in a quiet cul de sac and within easy reach of Northside Shopping Centre and local schools and shops. \n\nAccommodation briefly consists of an entrance hall leading to a sitting room and kitchen/dining room downstairs. Upstairs there are three bedrooms and a bathroom. \n \nThe property will require complete refurbishment throughout including a new heating system, replacement windows, a kitchen and bathroom. There is a driveway to the front providing off street parking and a private walled rear garden. \n\nThis property is ideally located close to many services and amenities including local schools and shops, Beaumont Hospital is within easy reach, and there is easy access to, M1 / M50, Dublin Airport, as well as the City Centre. \n\nGENERAL POINTS, SERVICES & UTILITIES:\n•The BER is F and the BER number is 119812410\n•Oil central heating not currently working\n•Single glazed aluminium windows\n\nOUTSIDE:\nWalled rear garden with a paved area and the balance laid in lawn, barna shed for storage, concrete shed with oil burner (not currently working). Drive in to the front providing off street parking. \n\nVIEWING: By Appointment Only\n\nNEGOTIATOR: BRIAN MASON\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ENTRANCE HALL:\nWith storage closet.\n\nSITTING ROOM: 4.7m x 3.3m\nSituated to the front.\n\nKITCHEN/DINING ROOM: 5.2m x 3.2m\nSituated to the rear with a door to the garden.\n\nUPSTAIRS\n\nBATHROOM: 3.0m x 1.7m\nThree-piece white suite, Bath with Triton electric shower, w.c., wash hand basin with vanity unit. Tiled floor.\n\nBEDROOM 1: 3.7m x 3.1m\nDouble bedroom to the rear.\n\nBEDROOM 2: 4.2m x 2.9m\nDouble bedroom to the front.\n\nBEDROOM 3: 3.3m x 2.2m\nSingle bedroom.\n\nTOTAL FLOOR AREA:\nc. 83sqm\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Within easy reach of M1/M50 </li><li> Within walking distance of Northside Shopping Centre </li><li> Within a stroll of local schools and shops. </li><li> Good transport links to the City Centre </li><li> Within easy reach of Beaumont Hospital</li></ul>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: F<br>BER No: 119812410<br>Energy Performance Indicator: 353.93 kWh/m2/yr"
